{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39934","headline":"长安即事三首 三 · 徐夤","name":"长安即事三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拖紫腰金不要论，便堪归隐白云村。\n更无名籍强金榜，岂有花枝胜杏园。\n绮席促时皆国器，羽觥飞处尽王孙。\n高眠亦是前贤事，争报春闱莫大恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}